  "notes": "{位置|いち}する means to be located or situated.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Pattern: Xに{位置|いち}する (to be located at/in X)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {位置|いち}している: is located (current state)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～に{位置|いち}する: to be located at/in ~\n- ～の{北|きた}/{南|みなみ}に{位置|いち}する: located to the north/south of ~\n- {中心|ちゅうしん}に{位置|いち}する: located in the center\n\nUSAGE NOTE:\n{位置|いち}する is more formal than ある. It's common in:\n- Geographic descriptions\n- Official documents\n- Academic writing\n\nRELATED:\n- {位置|いち}: position, location (noun)\n- ある: to be (general existence)\n- {所在|しょざい}する: to be situated (formal)",
